<title>PAKISTAN: Karachi port handles 84,427 tonnes cargo.</title>
<headline>Karachi port handles 84,427 tonnes cargo.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's Karachi Port Trust said it had handled 84,427 tonnes of export and import cargo in the 24 hours to 7 a.m. (0200 GMT) on Tuesday compared to 57,555 tonnes in the same period on Sunday.</p>
<p>Cargo handling in tonnes:</p>
<p>				    Tuesday     March 10</p>
<p>    Export cargo		26,589	30,085</p>
<p>    Import cargo		57,838	27,470</p>
<p>In the past 24 hours, three ships sailed and five berthed.</p>
<p>In the next 24 hours, seven are expected to sail and eight are expected to arrive.</p>
</text>
